{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:59f3b9a6b3ae047b","name":"Storm Beast","source":{"id":"source:reference-59f3b9a6b3ae047b","title":"Storm Beast","revision":20543,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:03:20Z","sha256":"10cad137204693f551a58127225227e2fd056900bbfc9c60e655ab2454f1062d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20543","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Storm%20Beast&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-59f3b9a6b3ae047b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Storm Beasts are hulking monstrosities that roam the surface of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},". Savage reptilian predators that stand about 2 meters tall, they possess vicious demeanors and abilities that have been augmented by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Storm Beasts are possibly the only native species of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"}," to survive after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Wars"},", since they are the only species found living on the world's surface. Their existence on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"}," stretches back as far as recorded history and beyond, though not much information is known about the planet before the war. Many historians believe that the Storm Beasts lived as natural creatures near the top of their food chain until the Trayus Academy was built by the group known as the Sith Triumvirate. While ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," who inhabited the academy conducted their sinister experiments, the energies they used affected the creatures around them, warping them into menacing beasts.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Storm Beasts, along with the other creatures in their ecosystem, continued to be immersed in the dark power well after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," withdrew from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},". Over time, the Storm Beasts eradicated competing predators, leaving themselves as sole masters of their world.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Storm Beast Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Around the time of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Civil War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Civil_War"}," and especially after the use of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mass Shadow Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mass_Shadow_Generator"}," by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bao-Dur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bao-Dur","referenceId":"reference:2c0e31369cc73445"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Exile"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Exile"},", Storm Beasts remain one of the last surviving species on the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},". With fewer creatures available for them to sustain themselves, the population of Storm Beasts has dwindled significantly. Those that remain harry visitors to the world.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Storm Beasts tend to be solitary creatures except during mating seasons. Outside of that timeframe, banding more than one together usually results in the beasts fighting each other until only one remains alive.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Storm Beast Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 14 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 14, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 76, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 14\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," 6 Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Melee:"]}," Claws (2) +10* (1d4+14)\n"]},{"tag":